1
00:00:00,207 --> 00:00:02,737
(Amy:)I think we're good.

2
00:00:02,743 --> 00:00:04,543
(Raj:)Okay, well,
thanks for coming by.

3
00:00:04,545 --> 00:00:05,615
(Bert:)You're nice people.

4
00:00:05,613 --> 00:00:08,283
(Penny:)Well, so are you.
In fact, you know what?

5
00:00:08,282 --> 00:00:11,622
(Penny:)We will never
take you for granite.

6
00:00:11,619 --> 00:00:14,719
(Penny:)Did you get that?
Granite?

7
00:00:14,722 --> 00:00:17,592
(Penny:)A little geology joke.

8
00:00:17,592 --> 00:00:18,992
(Bert:)You need to leave.

9
00:00:18,993 --> 00:00:20,323
(Bert:)I'm in love
with both of you now.

10
00:00:20,328 --> 00:00:22,128
(Penny:)Okay.
Bye.

11
00:00:25,366 --> 00:00:27,236
(Raj:)Uh, pull over.

12
00:00:27,234 --> 00:00:28,964
(Bernadette:)What? Why?
Who are you calling?

13
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:31,170
(Bernadette:)You're gonna rat me out
to Howard, aren't you?

14
00:00:31,172 --> 00:00:34,502
(Bernadette:)You're such a snitch,
no wonder I don't like you.

15
00:00:35,743 --> 00:00:38,743
(Raj:)Whoa, I'm calling
my dad, okay?

16
00:00:38,746 --> 00:00:40,976
(Raj:)He's got experience
dealing with pregnant ladies

17
00:00:40,982 --> 00:00:42,382
(Raj:)because he's an OBGYN.

18
00:00:42,383 --> 00:00:44,113
(Raj:)And experience
with crazy ladies

19
00:00:44,118 --> 00:00:45,448
(Raj:)because of my mom.

20
00:00:47,755 --> 00:00:49,355
(Dr Koothrapalli(on facetime):)Hello, Rajesh.

21
00:00:49,357 --> 00:00:50,757
(Bernadette:)Are you calling
to ask for money?

22
00:00:50,758 --> 00:00:51,688
(Raj:)What? No.

23
00:00:51,692 --> 00:00:52,822
(Dr Koothrapalli(on facetime):)Are you calling to ask
for things

24
00:00:52,827 --> 00:00:54,897
that cost money?
No.

25
00:00:54,895 --> 00:00:56,865
(Dr Koothrapalli:)Great. What's up?

26
00:00:56,864 --> 00:00:59,394
(Amy:)This is my friend,
Bernadette.

27
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,600
(Raj:)She's pregnant,
and she's a bit worried,

